ohansson's next appearances  Black Widow came in 2014's Captain  America the Winter Soldier starring  alongside super-ripped actor Chris Evans  is likely to make even the most  confident performer feel inadequate  but Johansson clearly rose to the  challenge talking to Elle in 2013 she  revealed I like lifting weights and  doing exercises to work my core muscles  to be honest I work out like a guy it's  this heavy focus on weight lifting  paired with her strict diet that gets  Johansson where she needs to be  Johansson told Access Hollywood  it's boring 5 a.m. workouts and salad  and chicken and nothing  pretty much it's that old tried-and-true  workout like a dude and eat like a  rabbit Johanssen also followed that  routine when it was time to get in shape  for 2015's Avengers age of Ultron we  picked up the same program we'd used for  Iron Man 2 and it had a proven history  Scarlett Johansson took a rather extreme  approach to training for Avengers  infinity war and endgame in an interview  with Harper's Bazaar her trainer Erik  Johnson revealed Johansson would often  fast for 12 hours a day sometimes even  longer and moments we pushed beyond that  to 14 to 15 hours depending on the  filming schedule Johnson's build even  more dirt on Johansson's diet to The  Hollywood Reporter claiming Johansson  dropped carbs and the days leading up to  the shoot in order to get some extra  enhancement on her cuts that's just the  kind of ruthlessly sneaky maneuver we've  come to expect from Black Widow isn't it  I adore you  [Music]  check out one of our newest videos right  here plus even more looper videos about  the MCU are coming soon subscribe to our  YouTube channel and hit the bell so you  don't miss a single one  [Music]
 

